<title>USA: TABLE - Arrow Q2 net income falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Arrow Q2 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN FALLS, N.Y. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			  2,518		    2,581</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	     236			224</p>
<p> Total assets	   792,372		  713,505</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,652		    5,931</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.95		    $1.66</p>
<p> Net			  5,400		   10,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 1997 core earnings per share, excluding nonrecurring items, was $0.41 vs $0.44 for the year-ago period.</p>
<p>1996 figures include balances and earnings from Vermont operation, since divested.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Arrow Financial Corp.</p>
